{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XcEUddQqnA6ZodqCF5i3cG","type":"tool_result","content":"---\nspec: pose-claude-reviewer-runs-tests-in-sandbox\ncategory: added\nbreaking: false\n---\n\n- Optional per-agent `review_profile` selects fresh and resumed governed-review commands without widening read tasks, adjudication or smoke.\n- This repository's Claude review profile executes tests in the mandatory shell sandbox, with private Go cache/temp scratch and absolute write denials for sealed source and the shared Git common directory. Missing bubblewrap, socat or jq refuses launch with installation advice; sandbox failure never falls back to an unrestricted command.\n\n- Typed Claude init repeats for the same session no longer cause a false capture refusal; conflicting identities and generic regex ambiguity remain refused, with original provenance/redaction bytes preserved.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"[private-session]","uuid":"2b87f981-5ecb-4642-951b-9afa87ab932b","timestamp":"2026-11-13T08:43:58.701Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"---\nspec: pose-claude-reviewer-runs-tests-in-sandbox\ncategory: added\nbreaking: false\n---\n\n- Optional per-agent `review_profile` selects fresh and resumed governed-review commands without widening read tasks, adjudication or smoke.\n- This repository's Claude review profile executes tests in the mandatory shell sandbox, with private Go cache/temp scratch and absolute write denials for sealed source and the shared Git common directory. Missing bubblewrap, socat or jq refuses launch with installation advice; sandbox failure never falls back to an unrestricted command.\n\n- Typed Claude init repeats for the same session no longer cause a false capture refusal; conflicting identities and generic regex ambiguity remain refused, with original provenance/redaction bytes preserved.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01XcEUddQqnA6ZodqCF5i3cG","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
